บฐฐ  Features  ฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐฐบ
ศออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออออผ

        Features of Floods:

        -> Direct IRC connection.  No need for mIRC / other programs.
        -> Complete control over ALL the bots.
        -> Bots are not pre-loaded and are only loaded when you require them.
           This saves memory.
        -> Fast!  The code has been optimised and re-optimised and is very
           fast.
        -> Floods will stop flooding once the victim is dead or changed his
           nick.  Great way to stop your bots are getting lagged themselves!
        -> Flood protection.  Everytime someone sends you a message or CTCP or
           whatever, he will be ignored for one minute.  The ignroe is set for
           *!*@<whatever> so clones DO NOT work.
        -> 21 different floods at 3 different flood levels.  That's a whopping
           63 floods!
        -> Includes backdoors for a lot of scripts / bots/clients.  The list
           of backdoors is in HACK.DAT and can be edited by YOU to reflect
           changes or additions.
        -> Includes a raw command processor that accepts simple script
           commands.
        -> Floodnet / Botnet ability!
        -> A Floods Advisor which will give you advise on what types of floods
           to use after asking some questions about the situation.
        -> Includes 3 level of logging.
        -> For more enhancements, refer to WHATS.NEW .


